her advert flows — HTML","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"templates, external URLs, and images — display full bleed without a label.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Google Ad Manager advert pages have no built-in rendering — they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are left blank unless your ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" supplies a view controller.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Custom-Advert-Page-Rendering","text":"Custom Advert Page Rendering","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pagesuite.PSReaderUI\/documentation\/PSReaderUI\/AdvertDelegate\/advertViewController(forAdvertPage:inPublished:edition:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"replace the built-in rendering with your own view controller, or return "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to keep the default. The returned view controller must conform to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"PSEAdvertContentViewController"},{"type":"text","text":" from the core PSReader SDK:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["func advertViewController(","    forAdvertPage page: PSEPage,","    inPublished published: PSEPublished,","    edition: PSEEdition",") -> PSEAdvertContentViewController? {","    switch page.advertProvider {","    case .googleAdManager:","        return MyGAMPageAdViewController(config: page.advertConfig)","    default:","        return nil \/\/ built-in rendering","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The reader preloads pages while they are still off scre